uni:Bio101 uni:hasCoTeacher uni:John_Smith .
uni:Bioinformatics_MIT uni:hasCoTeacher uni:John_Smith .
uni:Innovation_MIT uni:hasCoTeacher uni:Priya_Natarajan .
